{"book":{"id":"book-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian","slug":"into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian","title":"Into The Tangled Bank","authors":[{"id":"person-lev-parikian","name":"Lev Parikian"}],"publisherId":"publisher-elliott-and-thompson","imprintId":"imprint-elliott-and-thompson","isbn13":["9781783965069"],"subjects":["Science"],"topics":["Environment, Conservation & Pollution","Film, Television & Popular Culture","Regional & Local History"],"centralFigures":[],"links":{"amazon":"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Into%20The%20Tangled%20Bank%20Lev%20Parikian","bookshop":"https://bookshop.org/search?keywords=Into%20The%20Tangled%20Bank%20Lev%20Parikian","indiebound":"https://www.indiebound.org/search/book?keys=Into%20The%20Tangled%20Bank%20Lev%20Parikian","worldcat":"https://search.worldcat.org/search?q=Into%20The%20Tangled%20Bank%20Lev%20Parikian","publisher":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Into_the_Tangled_Bank.html?hl=&id=tsJtzQEACAAJ"},"sourceIds":["source-award-record-wainwright-nature-writing-wainwright-prize-official-2021-nature-writing-longlist","source-imprint-normalization","source-google-books-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian","source-open-library-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian","source-cover-google-books-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian"],"subjectCategories":[{"source":"google_books","scheme":"google_books_category","label":"Gardening","sourceId":"source-google-books-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biology","sourceId":"source-open-library-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian"}],"publicationYear":2020,"pageCount":288,"summary":"It's often said that the British are a nation of nature lovers; but what does that really mean? For some it's watching racer snakes chase iguanas on TV as David Attenborough narrates, a visit to the zoo to convene with the chimps; for others it's a far-too-ambitious clamber up a mountain, the thrilling spectacle of a rare bird in flight. Lev Parikian sets out to explore the many, and particular, ways that he,and we,experience the natural world. Starting with the pavement outside his house, he gradually moves outwards to garden, local patch, wildlife reserve, craggy coastline and as far afield as the dark hills of Skye. He visits the haunts of famous nature lovers -reaching back to the likes of Charles Darwin, Etta Lemon, Gavin Maxwell, John Clare and Emma Turner -to get up close to their insatiable curiosity and follow in their footsteps.","thumbnailUrl":"/book-covers/book-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian.jpg","displaySummary":"For some it's watching racer snakes chase iguanas on TV as David Attenborough narrates, a visit to the zoo to convene with the chimps; for others it's a far-too-ambitious clamber up a mountain, the thrilling spectacle of a rare bird in flight. Lev Parikian sets out to explore the many, and particular, ways that he,and we,experience the natural world. Starting with the pavement outside his house, he gradually moves outwards to garden, local patch, wildlife reserve, craggy coastline and as far afield as the dark hills of Skye. He visits the haunts of famous nature lovers -reaching back to the likes of Charles Darwin, Etta Lemon, Gavin Maxwell, John Clare and Emma Turner -to get up close to their insatiable curiosity and follow in their footsteps.","primarySubject":"Science","primaryTopic":"Environment, Conservation & Pollution","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Science","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Science","score":6,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Biology","mappedSubject":"Science","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian","id":"subject-evidence-book-into-the-tangled-bank-lev-parikian-1"},{"source":"award_category","rawLabel":"Wainwright Prize: Nature Writing","mappedSubject":"Nature & Environment","score":2,"confidence":